05:00+08:00\n   sustained downturn in digital assets.\nNews\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index, one of the most widely u\n7. Bitcoin Market Sentiment Reaches Extreme Fear as Price Volatility Tests Crypto Workforce\n   URL: https://crypto.jobs/news/bitcoin-market-sentiment-reaches-extreme-fear-as-price-volatility-tests-crypto-workforce\n   Source: CryptoJobs\n   Published: 2026-03-27T00:00:00+08:00\n   arket Sentiment Reaches Extreme Fear as Price Volatility Tests Crypto Workforce\nMarch 27, 2026\n 41 v\n8. Crypto Fear and Greed Index falls back down to 'extreme fear' levels\n   URL: https://cryptonews.net/news/analytics/32526278/\n   Source: Crypto News\n   Published: 2026-03-07T22:15:00+08:00\n   cointelegraph.com\n07 March 2026 22:15, UTC\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index, one of the most widely u\n9. Trending news\n   URL: https://www.bitget.online/news/detail/12560605264796\n   Source: Bitget\n   Published: 2026-03-14T14:15:00+08:00\n   Data: The current Crypto Fear & Greed Index is 15, indicating an extreme fear state.\nChaincatcher\n20\n10. Today's Fear and Greed Index drops to 11, indicating the market is in an \"extreme fear\" state.\n   URL: https://www.bitget.online/news/detail/12560605227078\n   Source: Bitget\n   Published: 2026-02-28T08:33:00+08:00\n   Today's Fear and Greed Index drops to 11, indicating the market is in an \"extreme fear\" state.\nFores"}],"details":{"query":"fear and greed index crypto today","type":"web","count":10,"items":[{"title":"Data: The current Crypto Fear &     Greed Index is 9, indicating an extreme fear state.","url":"https://www.bitget.online/news/detail/12560605315609","siteName":"Bitget","snippet":"Data: The current Crypto Fear & Greed Index is 9, indicating an extreme fear state.\nChaincatcher\n202","content":"Data: The current Crypto Fear & Greed Index is 9, indicating an extreme fear state.\nChaincatcher\n2026/03/30 12:32\nChainCatcher reports, according to Coinglass data, the current cryptocurrency Fear and Greed Index is 9, up 1 point from yesterday. The 7-day average is 10, and the 30-day average is 14.\n","publishTime":"2026-03-30T12:32:00+08:00"},{"title":"加密货币贪婪恐慌指数代表什么?如何查看?恐惧贪婪对市场有何影响?","url":"https://m.jb51.net/blockchain/1015367.html","siteName":"脚本之家","snippet":"万美元时，交易量能看到明显上升，进而推动指数接近90（极度贪婪）分。\n3. 社群媒体反应（Social Media）占15%\n藉由观察社交媒体上讨论的「热度变化」，也能影响市场情绪评估，例如当「#Bi","content":"加密货币贪婪恐慌指数代表什么？如何查看？恐惧贪婪对市场有何影响？\n2026-02-04 09:41:07 佚名\n简介你在币圈混久了，肯定听过“恐惧与贪婪指数”（Crypto Fear & Greed Index），也叫“加密货币恐慌指数”,每次市场大跌，全网都在喊“极度恐惧”，大涨时又人人FOMO（怕错过）,这玩意儿到底代表啥？它能不能真的帮你赚钱，而不是被情绪牵着鼻子走吗\n什么是恐惧与贪婪指数？如何查看恐惧与贪婪指数？恐惧与贪婪指数对加密货币市场有什么影响？\n你在币圈混久了，肯定听过“恐惧与贪婪指数”（Crypto Fear & Greed Index），也叫“加密货币恐慌指数”。每次市场大跌，全网都在喊“极度恐惧”，大涨时又人人FOMO（怕错过）。这玩意儿到底代表啥？它能不能真的帮你赚钱，而不是被情绪牵着鼻子走？实话实说，我自己刚入圈时，也被这个指数搞得心跳加速——指数低到谷底时，手抖着不敢买；高到顶时，又忍不住追涨。结果呢？好几次都在贪婪顶点接盘，恐惧底点清仓，亏得想哭。\n后来我才明白这个指数就是一面镜子，照出整个市场的集体情绪。懂了它，你就能反着来——别人恐慌时你贪婪，别人贪婪时你恐慌。这就是巴菲特那句名言的加密版啊！\n下面，脚本之家小编给大家详细介绍下加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数吧！\n国内最佳加密货币交易所\n交易平台 名称 综合评分 现货手续费 合约手续费 KY C认 证 充值提现方式 新用户福利 官网+APP下载OKX欧易 5.0 0.08% – 0.1% 0.02% – 0.05% ✅ 支付宝、微信\nC2C / 银行卡 邀请码jbzj999注册参与新用户活动+20% 手续费减免 官网+APP下载Binance币安 5.0 0.10% 0.02% – 0.05% ✅ 支付宝、微信\nC2C / 银行卡 邀请码A0Y8K980注册参与新用户活动+20% 手续费减免 官网+APP下载Gate.io 5.0 0.10% 0.02% – 0.05% ✅ 支付宝、微信\nC2C / 银行卡 邀请码VLIWUGTFAA注册参与新用户活动+20% 手续费减免 官网+APP下载Bybit 4.9 0.10% 0.01% – 0.055% ✅ P2P、银行卡\nApplePay / GooglePay 邀请码jbzj999注册参与新用户活动+20% 手续费减免 官网+APP下载Bitget 4.9 0.10% 0.02% – 0.06% ✅ 银行卡、P2P\n信用卡充值 邀请码vxje注册参与新用户活动+20% 手续费减免 官网+APP下载火币 4.9 0.20% 0.02% – 0.06% ✅ 支付宝、微信\nC2C / 银行卡 邀请码b6yq8223注册参与新用户活动+20% 手续费减免 官网+APP下载\n加密货币恐慌指数是什么\n其实它就是一个0-100分的打分表，衡量整个加密市场（主要是比特币）的“情绪温度”：\n0-24：极度恐惧（Extreme Fear）\n全网都在慌：价格暴跌、人人割肉、论坛全是“币圈已死”。但历史数据告诉你，这往往是超级抄底机会！那种“全世界都放弃了”的绝望感，其实是牛市起点的前奏。\n25-49：恐惧（Fear）\n大家还在担心，但没到崩溃。适合慢慢建仓。\n50：中性（Neutral）\n就像现在（2026年1月15日，49分），市场不冷不热，没啥极端情绪。观望为主，或者小仓位试水。\n51-74：贪婪（Greed）\n价格涨了，大家开始兴奋，FOMO上头，朋友圈全是晒收益。这时候要小心了——贪婪往往是顶部信号。\n75-100：极度贪婪（Extreme Greed）\n全网狂欢，空气币乱飞，新手疯狂入场。这时候？老韭菜已经在准备跑路了。记住：极度贪婪后，往往跟着大回调。\n当指数掉到极度恐惧时，我曾经彻夜失眠，看着账户缩水20%，真想全部卖掉。但每次熬过去，回头看，都是最低点附近。反过来，极度贪婪时，那种“币圈要上天”的亢奋，真的会让人失去理智——我有过一次，全仓追涨，结果被套半年。\n加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数的计算方法\n从上面的描述来看，似乎这个恐惧与贪婪指数相当准确，能够抓到当时市场的氛围，同时也与比特币价格对得上，那它究竟是如何计算的呢？\n其实 Alternative.me 网站并没有详细公布所有计算细节，但官方网站有列出以下值得参考的资讯，其计算方式主要包括：\n1. 波动率（Volatility）占25%\n价格大幅波动通常意味着市场恐惧升高，而相对稳定的市场则代表信心较强。例如2022 年5 月，Terra/LUNA 事件导致市场大跌，比特币单日波动超过15%，当时加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数「迅速」跌至20（极度恐惧）以下。\n2. 市场动能与交易量（Market Momentum／Volume）占25%\n当交易量放大，同时价格上升时，往往显示着市场贪婪情绪升温。例如2021 年10 月，比特币正式突破6 万美元时，交易量能看到明显上升，进而推动指数接近90（极度贪婪）分。\n3. 社群媒体反应（Social Media）占15%\n藉由观察社交媒体上讨论的「热度变化」，也能影响市场情绪评估，例如当「#BitcoinToTheMoon」的推文越多时，意味着更多加密货币投资者是相当看好后市，就意味着市场越贪婪，分数就会上升。\n4. 比特币市占率（Bitcoin Dominance）占10%\n当比特币市占上升，代表投资者更倾向于减少风险，因为比特币是整个加密货币市场里，相对波动率、期望报酬率较稳定的币种；相反地，当资金转向其他山寨币（如Solana、XRP 等），则意味着市场更加贪婪。例如2021 年5 月，比特币市占率从70% 一度在短短几周内降至40%，显示市场贪婪情绪高涨，投资者更愿意转向高风险、高报酬的项目标的。\n5. Google 搜寻趋势（Google Trends）占10%\n比如「Bitcoin crash (比特币崩盘)」这类关键字的搜寻量提升时，通常显示着市场恐惧蔓延，因为更多人会担心市场是否真的会崩盘。从另一个角度来说也一样，当人们积极参与加密货币市场时，比如「buy Bitcoin」搜寻量上升时，就代表着市场情绪相对乐观。\n6. 市场调查（Surveys）占15%\nAlternative.me 官方网站明确显著，他们会透过投资者问卷调查来评估当前市场的整体情绪，但实际方式，笔者并没有找到相关资料。\n简单来说，加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数就像是币圈投资市场的「情绪报告」，有些分析师认为，当指数偏向恐惧时，意味着投资人可考虑逢低买入；当指数显示极度贪婪，则可能意味着市场即将过热回落。了解这些讯号，能帮助我们投资时更理性地进行交易决策，避免因市场情绪波动而做出非理性的投资行为。\n怎么查看实时恐慌指数？\n直接上官网：https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/\n一打开就看到大数字 + 历史走势图，超级直观。\n手机App：TradingView、CoinMarketCap、Binance App里都有内置。\n微信小程序/浏览器搜索“加密恐惧贪婪指数”，一堆实时工具。\n我习惯每天早上第一件事就是看一眼——比看K线还重要，因为它告诉你“现在该冷静还是该激动”。\n左侧显示的是当前的恐惧与贪婪指数（0～100 分）；\n中间显示的则是时间，分为现在（Now）、昨天（Yesterday）、上周（Last week）、上个月（Last month）；\n最右侧则是显示本指数将于何时更新最新资讯（每日一更）。\n恐惧与贪婪如何影响加密货币市场？\n币圈有一个词叫做「FUD」，意旨Fear（恐惧）、Uncertainty（不确定性）和Doubt（怀疑）。在现实生活中，当人们恐惧时会更倾向于避免风险，比如得知全球有经济衰退的风险时，我们会想将手上的加密货币、股票等资产赶紧抛售，避免这些项目、公司在经济下行趋势中倒闭或亏损，进而造成我们更大的亏损，也就是「长痛不如短痛」，应迅速卖掉这些资产。\n然而在所谓的「恐惧」，往往是由于某些不确定性所带来的不理性情绪，就像2020 年全球新冠COVID-19 疫情刚开始蔓延时，当时社会弥漫着一股「全球经济要完蛋了」的氛围，许多加密货币、公司股票在人们惊慌的情绪下不断被卖出，情绪如雪球般越滚越大，事后诸葛来看，当时其实是加密货币投资者最佳买入的「抄底好时机」。\n当时的加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数显示，2020 年币圈整体投资市场的情绪相对低迷，平均位于50 以下，且时常出现45 分之下的恐惧情绪。当时比特币价格一度跌破4000 美元。但当市场冷静下来后，比特币迅速回升至1 万美元以上，突显市场恐惧与现实公允价值之间的落差。\n2020 年恐慌的加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数| 图片来源：Alternative.me\n而在乐观情绪上，币圈也有一个词称为「FOMO」，全称为Fear of Missing out，也就是人们因害怕错过「价格不断上涨」的趋势，进而不理性的疯狂买入。在2021 年加密货币牛市时，因Paypal 入局、NFT 热潮、元宇宙虚拟世界等利好消息层出不穷，加密货币社群呈现一个相当乐观的氛围，同时市场交易量不断上升，越来越多人开始参与这个市场，使得加密货币价格被不断推高。\n以2021 年11 月来说，比特币当时达到历史新高，在市场狂热的情况下，比特币价格突破 68,000 美元，恐惧与贪婪指数更是一度达到94 分的极度贪婪94。过度乐观的市场氛围，导致众多投资者FOMO 进场，人们正在不理性的买入被高估的资产。\n2021 年乐观的加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数｜图片来源：Alternative.me\n怎么利用用恐慌指数赚钱\n反向操作原则：\n指数 < 25（极度恐惧）→ 大胆分批买入（历史多次牛市起点都在这）。\n指数 > 75（极度贪婪）→ 减仓、落袋为安，别追涨。\n结合其他信号：别只看指数！搭配比特币价格、ETF资金流、大新闻使用。比如现在49分中性，如果你看好长期，就继续定投；如果短期想博弈，等下一次极度恐惧再加仓。\n真实案例：\n2022年熊市底，指数长期在10-20区间，那时候买BTC的人，现在2026年已经翻了好几倍。\n2021年牛市顶，指数冲到95+，很多人All in，结果之后大跌50%+。\n那种在极度恐惧中买入的感觉，真的需要勇气。但事后回头看，你会为自己点赞原来我也能成为那个冷静的人！最后想吼你一句兄弟姐妹，加密市场99%是情绪博弈。\n恐慌指数不是神器，但它是你对抗人性弱点的利器。\n加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数能预测比特币价格？\n不过写到这里，经验较丰富的投资者应该会想问一个问题：「如果恐惧与贪婪指数真的这么准，那它是不是可以直接做为买卖 比特币的标准呢？」\n答案是：「不能，因为加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数，并不能精准的预测比特币与其他加密货币的价格。」\n以下我们来详细对比一下恐惧与贪婪指数与比特币价格的走势差异。\n加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数对比比特币价格走势| 来源TradingView\n从上图我们可以看到：\n上半部绿、红交接的线图：2021～2022 年的比特币价格走势\n下半部黑色虚线（橘色标示）：2021～2022 年恐惧与贪婪指数的走势\n我们能清楚的看到，两者之间的走势其实非常相似，但彼此之间并不是完全相关的，当下的恐惧与贪婪指数指数，并不能预测比特币价格的未来方向。\n比如说，当恐惧与贪婪指数超过60 分，市场处于较贪婪的情绪之下，并不意味着绝佳的卖出时机，与之相对地，我们还有可能错失掉一大段涨幅。反面来看，当恐惧与贪婪指数低于20 时，也不代表当时就是最好的买入时间，因为后续市场未必会迅速地迎来反弹，长期来看价格也未必是最好的相对低点。\n就结论而言，光靠加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数作为唯一的交易策略指标是相当单薄的，因为一时的市场低迷，并不意味着长期市场就会持续低迷（下跌）。反之，一时的市场乐观，也不代表市场会长期乐观（上涨）。\n加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数三大注意事项\n1. 加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数属于滞后指标\n诚然加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数可以不错地反映当下市场情绪，与比特币价格相关性高，但我们前面提到，此指标「一天只更新一次」，既无法及时地观察市场此时此刻的情绪，也意味着它是个滞后指标，也就是加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数更像是「统整观察」一天之内的市场情绪轮廓，而非向未来的价格去做预测。\n例如，在2021 年的加密货币牛市中，即使10 月的恐惧与贪婪指数达到75（极度贪婪）之上，价格仍然有继续上升的机会。\n2021 加密货币牛市恐惧与贪婪指数对比比特币价格| 来源Trading View\n2. 加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数有其局限性\n影响加密货币市场的因素众多，包含但不限于：\n总体经济变化例如美国联准会预计即将降息，让市场认为全球资金将开启较宽松的趋势，进而使比特币价格上涨。\n各国监管政策变化例如中国禁止比特币挖矿，造成矿工大规模撤离、比特币价格崩跌的519 事件。\n技术发展或创新例如以太坊2.0 的升级，让市场认为以太坊的应用价值将大幅上升，成为项目基本面的利好因素。\n回归我们开头所说的，投资市场里最重要的是「人」，而影响一个人买卖的因素远不只有情绪。藉由综合观察产业基本面、市场趋势等资讯，协助判断投资决策，才会是更加稳当的投资习惯。\n3. 留意项目本身的风险\n加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数能够看出当下币圈市场的整体情绪，但它无法看到「个别项目本身」的基本面、消息面等资讯。在判断自己投资的标的时，应综合手上项目标的的特性、未来发展及竞品等因素判断，别因为恐惧与贪婪指数所显示的恐慌／贪婪分数，反而被「情绪」给冲昏了头，做出不理性的投资决策。\n加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数常见问答集\nQ1：加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数是什么？\nAlternative.me 的「恐惧贪婪指数（Fear and Greed Index）」，会根据交易量、社交媒体热度、Google 搜寻趋势等参数计算出来，以0～100 分来表示市场的情绪状态。\n0～24 分为极度恐惧（Extreme Fear）；\n25～45 分为恐惧（Fear）；\n46～54 分为中等（Neutral）；\n55～74 分为贪婪（Greed）；\n75～100 分为极度贪婪（Extreme Greed）。\nQ2：加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数能预测比特币价格？\n不能。回顾历史数据，虽然恐惧与贪婪指数与比特币价格之间的正相关性高，但当下的指数并不能准确的预测价格的未来方向。\nQ3：加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数，使用上有哪些要注意的部分？\n第一、加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数属于滞后指标，指标本身无法预测比特币价格。\n第二、加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数有其局限性，藉由综合观察产业基本面、市场趋势等资讯，协助判断投资决策，才会是更加稳当的投资习惯。\n第三、依然需留意非系统性风险，此指数无法看到个别项目本身的基本面、消息面等资讯。别因为恐惧与贪婪指数所显示的恐慌／贪婪分数，反而被「情绪」给冲昏了头。\n最后\n加密货币恐惧与贪婪指数是币圈市场中，相当常见也很重要指标，它能帮助投资者了解市场情绪、判断市场热度并规划投资策略。虽然它并非万能工具，但若与技术分析与基本面分析等指标搭配使用，将能够提高决策准确度，减少因情绪波动而造成的操作失误。虽然恐惧与贪婪指数无法精准预测比特币价格，但我们还是能透过当下的恐慌／贪婪分数，来去判断现在市场是否过热或过冷，进而小部位的调整自己的仓位配置，决定要获利了结或是抄底加仓。\n中国国内使用最多的加密货币交易所\n1.币安\n币安是国际领先的区块链数字资产交易平台，它向全球提供广泛的数字货币交易、区块链教育、区块链项目孵化、区块链资产发行平台、区块链研究院以及区块链公益慈善等服务，目前用户覆盖了全球190多个国家和地区。\n币安平台的特点\n币安平台拥有众多功能，使其在全球最著名的数字货币交易所排行榜上名列第一。\n下面我们监控币安平台最突出的功能：\n超过350种可交易货币：币安平台为用户提供超过350种可交易数字货币，这为交易者和投资者提供了多种选择。\n交易费用低：币安平台的交易费用相比其他平台是最低的，这有助于用户节省更多费用。\n多种交易选项：币安平台为用户提供多种交易选项，包括点对点交易、现货交易和保证金交易。\n多种服务：正如我们之前提到的，币安平台服务不仅限于数位货币交易，还包括许多其他服务，例如不可替代代币交易、Binance Pay、Trust Wallet等。\n安全性：币安具有高度的安全性；这要归功于它遵循严格的协议和技术程序。\n速度：币安平台的特点是交易速度快，与其他平台相比，完成交易不需要很长时间。\n提供教育内容：币安平台最突出的特点是其学院提供的教育内容，旨在丰富知识并提高对数位货币和区块链技术等相关新兴技术的认识。\n可在多个系统上使用：币安在多个系统上提供服务，您可以透过网站透过桌面装置进行交易，也可以透过适用于 Android 用户的应用程式（Android 和 iOS）透过行动装置进行交易。\n全天候支援：币安每周 7 天、每天 24 小时为客户提供聊天支援。\n币安平台的缺点\n尽管币安平台有很多优点，但不幸的是它也有一些缺点。\n以下我们监控币安平台最突出的缺点：\n限量版：尽管币安平台为用户提供超过 350 种数位货币进行交易，但某些版本并不包含所有这些货币。\n例如，美国版本仅包含 150 种数位货币的交易。\n使用难度：在Bayance平台上交易并不容易，因为交易过程很复杂，尤其是对于初学者来说。\n尽管币安平台提供的众多交易选项被认为是重要优势，但它们可能会给许多用户带来困惑和困惑。\n缺乏内建数位钱包：虽然大多数交易所都有内建数位钱包，但币安却没有，因为该平台支援的 Trust 钱包未与其整合。\n监管问题：币安平台在全球许多国家已经并将继续面临许多监管问题，甚至在一些国家被封锁。\n官网地址、官方APP下载\n币安Binance邀请码：A0Y8K980\n币安交易所官网\n币安交易所APP下载\n中国地区的苹果手机如何下载Binance？币安下载、注册、入金出金、买币卖币教学\n2.火币\n火币集团是知名数字经济领军企业，自2013年创立以来，一直致力于区块链领域的核心技术突破以及区块链技术和产业融合。围绕区块链产业上下游，发展包括产业区块链、公链、数字资产交易、数字资产安全钱包、矿池、投资、孵化、研究等多业务板块，先后投资60+上下游企业，已形成全面的数字经济产业生态体系。\n优点\n平台功能和服务完善，是一个非常全面的虚拟货币交易所。\n成立于 2013 年，历经了几个市场周期，已经成熟运营很多年。\n针对大资金客户有很多专属支援。\n缺点\n被骇历史较多，不过都有全额补偿。\n部分功能最小交易额比较高，不太适合小资金交易者。\n火币官网、官方APP下载\n火币邀请码：b6yq8223\nHTX火币交易所官网\nHTX火币交易所APP下载\n2026最新火币HTX(原Huobi)官方APP下载与安装注册教程（安卓+苹果双版本）\n3.欧易OKX\n欧易OKX创立了统一交易账户等全球领先的Crypto交易系统，推出了MetaX，提供多链none-custody钱包、欧易NFT市场、DEX、Dapps等产品，OEC作为其自研公链，生态建设也初露头角，能够满足用户多种数字资产业务需求。后续欧易OKX将持续向元宇宙、Web3.0、GameFi等领域进发，OKX Ventures已在全球投资了数百个区块链项目，推动加密经济的繁荣。\n优点：\n币种多，支持中文界面，支持人民币交易，超低手续费，注册方便，交易量大，用户数量多。\n流动性高\n广泛的交易服务\n安全可靠\n用户界面友好\n缺点：\n交易费用略高\n偶尔会出现技术问题\n欧易官网、官方APP下载\nOKX欧易交易所邀请码：jbzj999\n欧易交易所官网\n欧易交易所APP下载\n2026年欧易（okx）开户多久能交易？安全吗？下载/注册/买币提现全面教学\n4.Gate.io\nGate.io交易平台成立于2013年4月，注册地为开曼，它已于2020年7月更名为“芝麻开门”。该平台有多年的稳定运营经验，积累了众多行业领先的技术，它通过中心化和去中心化双重手段保障了用户的资产安全，为用户提供了高效便捷的实时交易服务系统。作为全球历史最长和交易量最大的交易平台之一，芝麻开门严格遵循行业规则，不参与市场运作。\n优点\n不强制要求 KYC\n可交易海量山寨币\n提供了完整的 API 文档和 SDK，方便开发者进行程序化交易和开发应用\n缺点\nAPP 更新频率较低\n交易介面稍嫌杂乱\n高级交易功能较少\nGate.io官网、官方APP下载\nGate.io芝麻开门邀请码：VLIWUGTFAA\nGate.io交易所官网\nGate.io交易所APP下载\n芝麻开门交易所怎么注册？Gate.io下载注册教程(2026最新)\n5.Bitget\nBitget交易所支持500+个虚拟货币在线实时交易，持有加拿大MSB牌照M20179708、美国MSB、澳大利亚DCE等牌照，在2022年陆续新增理财、半价买币、投票上币、合约策略交易以及为SBGB增加更多赋能,是适合各面向投资人使用的一站式加密货币交易所。\n优点\n800+ 币种可选\n跟单交易优势\n费用低廉，享受 BGB 折扣\n强有力的安全措施\n3 亿美元保护基金\n缺点\n某些地区不提供服务\nKYC 强制性\n美国访问受限\nBitget交易所官网+官方APP下载\nBitget邀请码：vxje\nBitget交易所官网\nBitget交易所APP下载\nBitget在中国能用吗？Bitget是否支持中国大陆用户下载注册使用？\n6.Bybit\nBybit交易所是一款为初学者和专业人士设计的加密货币交易应用程序。它简化了热门加密货币的购买过程，提供现货和衍生品交易对，并具有多种特色功能，如统一侧栏字段的衍生品交易、高级限价单设置、新手轻松交易选项等，还包括资产管理、复制交易、NFT 市场等功能。\n优点\n排名前三大的交易所，具有一定的规模\n介面清楚、操作简单，新手也能快速学习如何操作\n不需KYC 也能交易（但还是建议KYC，提高提现额度）\n安全性足够，手续费也蛮便宜的\n缺点\n不能用新台币直接入金（大部份国际型交易所目前都不支援新台币入金）\nBybit官网、官方APP下载\nbybit邀请码：jbzj999\nBybit官网\nBybit官方APP下载\nBybit新手全攻略(2026最新)：注册、认证、充值和比特币购买详细操作指南\n以上就是脚本之家小编给大家分享的加密货币贪婪恐慌指数代表什么？如何查看？恐惧贪婪对市场有何影响？的详细介绍了，希望大家喜欢！\n","publishTime":"2026-02-04T09:38:00+08:00"},{"title":"Data: The current Crypto Fear and Greed Index is 8, indicating an extreme fear state.","url":"https://www.bitget.online/news/detail/12560605313990","siteName":"Bitget","snippet":"Data: The current Crypto Fear and Greed Index is 8, indicating an extreme fear state.\nChaincatcher\n2","content":"Data: The current Crypto Fear and Greed Index is 8, indicating an extreme fear state.\nChaincatcher\n2026/03/29 12:32\nChainCatcher news, according to Coinglass data, the cryptocurrency Fear and Greed Index is currently at 8, down 3 points from yesterday. The 7-day average is 10, and the 30-day average is 14.\n","publishTime":"2026-03-29T12:32:00+08:00"},{"title":"Data: The current Crypto Fear and Greed Index is 14, indicating a state of extreme fear.","url":"https://www.bitget.online/news/detail/12560605309096","siteName":"Bitget","snippet":"Data: The current Crypto Fear and Greed Index is 14, indicating a state of extreme fear.\nChaincatche","content":"Data: The current Crypto Fear and Greed Index is 14, indicating a state of extreme fear.\nChaincatcher\n2026/03/27 12:32\nChainCatcher news, according to data from Coinglass, the current Crypto Fear & Greed Index is 14, up 5 points from yesterday. The average for the past 7 days is 11, and the average for the past 30 days is 14.\n","publishTime":"2026-03-27T12:32:00+08:00"},{"title":"Today’s Fear &     Greed Index has retu...","url":"https://www.techflowpost.com/en-US/newsletter/116138","siteName":"深潮TechFlow","snippet":"Exclusive\n24 days ago\nToday’s Fear & Greed Index has returned to single digits, currently at 8, inte","content":"Exclusive\n24 days ago\nToday’s Fear & Greed Index has returned to single digits, currently at 8, intensifying the “Extreme Fear” state.\nTechFlow News: On March 9, according to Alternative.me data, the Crypto Fear & Greed Index dropped to 8 today (down from 12 yesterday), indicating an intensifying “extreme fear” market sentiment.\nToday’s Fear & Greed Index has retu...\nAccording to data from Alternative.me, today’s Crypto Fear & Greed Index has dropped to 8 (yesterday’s index was 12), indicating an intensification of the market’s “extreme fear” state.\n2026.03.09 08:06:09\n","publishTime":"2026-03-09T08:06:00+08:00"},{"title":"Crypto Fear and Greed Index falls back down to 'extreme fear' levels","url":"https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-fear-greed-index-extreme-fear","siteName":"Cointelegraph","snippet":"sustained downturn in digital assets.\nNews\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index, one of the most widely u","content":"Written by Vince Quill,\nStaff Writer\nCrypto Fear and Greed Index falls back down to 'extreme fear' levels\nMar 08, 2026\nCrypto investor sentiment has been in freefall ever since the October 2025 market crash that kicked off a sustained downturn in digital assets.\nNews\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index, one of the most widely used gauges of crypto investor sentiment, has fallen back down to “extreme fear” levels after briefly recovering on Wednesday.\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index is at 18 at the time of this writing, down from the 20 recorded on Friday, according to CoinMarketCap. 20 signals “fear,” an atmosphere of caution among investors, but an improvement over rock-bottom market sentiment.\nSentiment briefly spiked to 25 on Wednesday, but contracted as geopolitical tensions between the US, Israel and Iran continue to erode risk appetite and increase macroeconomic uncertainty among market participants.\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index hits 18, signaling “extreme fear” among investors. Source: CoinMarketCap\nThe index hit a yearly low of 5 in February amid the crypto market downturn and several headwinds, including renewed geopolitical tensions and macroeconomic concerns, such as uncertainty over interest rate policy, liquidity levels and rising US government debt.\nCrypto assets have been in a bear market since the October 2025 crash, which slashed the price of Bitcoin\n(BTC)\nby over 50% from its all-time high, before BTC staged a limited recovery, and\nerased hundreds of billions of dollars\nin value from the altcoin market.\nAlts suffer the most as sentiment craters\n38% of altcoins are hovering near all-time low prices, which is more severe than the aftermath of the FTX collapse, according to CryptoQuant analyst Darkfost.\nThe price collapse was accompanied by about a 50% reduction in crypto trading volume, Darkfost told Cointelegraph.\n38% of altcoins are hovering at or near all-time low prices. Source: CryptoQuant\n“Altcoins remain the last sector of the crypto market where liquidity typically flows, so this situation is not surprising, given the geopolitical and macroeconomic deterioration observed over the past several months,” he said.\nMentions of altcoins on social media platforms sank to their lowest level in two years, according to crypto market sentiment analysis platform Santiment.\nIn February 2026, worldwide Google search volume for “Bitcoin going to zero” also hit its highest level since 2022, according to data  from Google Trends, corroborating the low investor confidence measured by other sentiment indicators.\n#CoinMarketCap\n#Market Analysis\n#Industry\n","publishTime":"2026-03-07T22:05:00+08:00"},{"title":"Bitcoin Market Sentiment Reaches Extreme Fear as Price Volatility Tests Crypto Workforce","url":"https://crypto.jobs/news/bitcoin-market-sentiment-reaches-extreme-fear-as-price-volatility-tests-crypto-workforce","siteName":"CryptoJobs","snippet":"arket Sentiment Reaches Extreme Fear as Price Volatility Tests Crypto Workforce\nMarch 27, 2026\n 41 v","content":"Bitcoin Market Sentiment Reaches Extreme Fear as Price Volatility Tests Crypto Workforce\nMarch 27, 2026\n 41 views\nBitcoin market sentiment has entered extreme fear territory, with the Fear and Greed Index registering 13 out of 100 as of March 27, 2026. The reading comes as bitcoin trades near $66,000, down from its late 2025 peak above $120,000, creating uncertainty across crypto organizations and their hiring strategies.\nMarket Conditions Impact Industry Stability\nThe Fear and Greed Index, which aggregates data from price volatility, market momentum, trading volume, bitcoin dominance, social sentiment, and search trends, provides a quantitative measure of market psychology. Extreme fear readings typically correlate with periods of liquidity contraction and elevated volatility—conditions that historically influence crypto company operational decisions.\nRecent market action saw bitcoin drop to its lowest level in over two weeks, with more than $300 million in long position liquidations occurring within 24 hours. The disproportionate ratio between long and short liquidations indicates leveraged bullish positions were forced out, reflecting broader risk-off sentiment affecting both crypto and traditional markets.\nThe decline coincided with weakening equity markets, including a 10% drop in Nasdaq 100 futures from recent highs, alongside rising oil prices approaching $100 per barrel due to geopolitical tensions. Bitcoin has traded within a $60,000 to $75,000 range for several weeks following its previous peak.\nWorkforce Implications During Market Stress\nMarket downturns historically impact crypto sector employment patterns. Previous bear market phases saw companies implement hiring freezes, workforce reductions, and project delays as funding conditions tightened and revenue streams contracted.\nInstitutional investment flows show mixed signals that may affect crypto companies' growth trajectories. While spot bitcoin ETFs recorded substantial inflows earlier in March, recent sessions showed outflows. On-chain data indicating continued exchange withdrawals suggests long-term holders are moving to self-custody, potentially signaling conviction among experienced market participants.\nFor blockchain professionals, extreme fear periods have previously created opportunities alongside challenges. Companies with strong balance sheets often use market stress to attract talent at more favorable terms, while startups may face funding difficulties that affect hiring plans.\nWeb3 professionals should monitor whether institutional participation stabilizes and whether the current price range holds, as these factors will likely influence near-term employment conditions across the crypto industry.\n","publishTime":"2026-03-27T00:00:00+08:00"},{"title":"Crypto Fear and Greed Index falls back down to 'extreme fear' levels","url":"https://cryptonews.net/news/analytics/32526278/","siteName":"Crypto News","snippet":"cointelegraph.com\n07 March 2026 22:15, UTC\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index, one of the most widely u","content":"Crypto Fear and Greed Index falls back down to 'extreme fear' levels\ncointelegraph.com\n07 March 2026 22:15, UTC\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index, one of the most widely used gauges of crypto investor sentiment, has fallen back down to “extreme fear” levels after briefly recovering on Wednesday.\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index is at 18 at the time of this writing, down from the 20 recorded on Friday, according to CoinMarketCap. 20 signals “fear,” an atmosphere of caution among investors, but an improvement over rock-bottom market sentiment.\nSentiment briefly spiked to 25 on Wednesday, but contracted as geopolitical tensions between the US, Israel and Iran continue to erode risk appetite and increase macroeconomic uncertainty among market participants.\nThe Crypto Fear and Greed Index hits 18, signaling “extreme fear” among investors. Source: CoinMarketCap\nThe index hit a yearly low of 5 in February amid the crypto market downturn and several headwinds, including renewed geopolitical tensions and macroeconomic concerns, such as uncertainty over interest rate policy, liquidity levels and rising US government debt.\nCrypto assets have been in a bear market since the October 2025 crash, which slashed the price of Bitcoin ($BTC) by over 50% from its all-time high, before $BTC staged a limited recovery, and erased hundreds of billions of dollars in value from the altcoin market.\nAlts suffer the most as sentiment craters\n38% of altcoins are hovering near all-time low prices, which is more severe than the aftermath of the FTX collapse, according to CryptoQuant analyst Darkfost.\nThe price collapse was accompanied by about a 50% reduction in crypto trading volume, Darkfost told Cointelegraph.\n38% of altcoins are hovering at or near all-time low prices. Source: CryptoQuant\n“Altcoins remain the last sector of the crypto market where liquidity typically flows, so this situation is not surprising, given the geopolitical and macroeconomic deterioration observed over the past several months,” he said.\nMentions of altcoins on social media platforms sank to their lowest level in two years, according to crypto market sentiment analysis platform Santiment.\nIn February 2026, worldwide Google search volume for “Bitcoin going to zero” also hit its highest level since 2022, according to data from Google Trends, corroborating the low investor confidence measured by other sentiment indicators.\n","publishTime":"2026-03-07T22:15:00+08:00"},{"title":"Trending news","url":"https://www.bitget.online/news/detail/12560605264796","siteName":"Bitget","snippet":"Data: The current Crypto Fear & Greed Index is 15, indicating an extreme fear state.\nChaincatcher\n20","content":"Data: The current Crypto Fear & Greed Index is 15, indicating an extreme fear state.\nChaincatcher\n2026/03/14 14:15\nChainCatcher news, according to Coinglass data, the current cryptocurrency Fear and Greed Index is 15, up 1 point from yesterday. The 7-day average is 13, and the 30-day average is 11.\n","publishTime":"2026-03-14T14:15:00+08:00"},{"title":"Today's Fear and Greed Index drops to 11, indicating the market is in an \"extreme fear\" state.","url":"https://www.bitget.online/news/detail/12560605227078","siteName":"Bitget","snippet":"Today's Fear and Greed Index drops to 11, indicating the market is in an \"extreme fear\" state.\nFores","content":"Today's Fear and Greed Index drops to 11, indicating the market is in an \"extreme fear\" state.\nForesightNews\n2026/02/28 08:33\nForesight News reported that, according to data from Alternative.me, today the Crypto Fear & Greed Index dropped to 11 (yesterday the index was 13, indicating an \"Extreme Fear\" state), showing that the market is in an \"Extreme Fear\" state.\n","publishTime":"2026-02-28T08:33:00+08:00"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775268652269}}
